{"2144020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Combat: Accelerated", "steam_appid": 2144020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for checking out Fish Combat: Accelerated!!! Now go Check out <strong>Hyper Fin</strong> haha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Due to a few mistakes on our part, we ended up with two Fish Combat pages. <strong>Hyper Fin</strong>, our other page, will be launching first so go check that out if you want some Fast-Paced Combat Goodness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page is gathering interest for a Speedrunning Action-Adventure take on the formula we're crafting in <strong>Hyper Fin</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.poster.avif?t=1779119345\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.webm?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.mp4?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On to the Fun Part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/0544ae26078eb26cc66c8020d18c3199.poster.avif?t=1779119345\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/0544ae26078eb26cc66c8020d18c3199.webm?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/0544ae26078eb26cc66c8020d18c3199.mp4?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Combat is a Movement Base Fighting game built for speedrunning. Every system in the game, from combat to gravity defying platforming, encourages you to move FAST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've played Hyper Fin and would like an Action-Adventure, Speedrunning game in a similar world, please give this a wish list and we'll move things along faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/88ce537b3f18f6e85048988867bb2ea6.poster.avif?t=1779119345\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/88ce537b3f18f6e85048988867bb2ea6.webm?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144020/extras/88ce537b3f18f6e85048988867bb2ea6.mp4?t=1779119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for checking out Fish Combat: Accelerated!!! Now go Check out <strong>Hyper Fin</strong> haha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Due to a few mistakes on our part, we ended up with two Fish Combat pages. <strong>Hyper Fin</strong>, our other page, will be launching first so go check that out if you want some Fast-Paced Combat Goodness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This page is gathering interest for a Speedrunning Action-Adventure take on the formula we're crafting in <strong>Hyper Fin</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=